---
/**
 * BinsSection (#bins): the shared bins visual (data-visual="bins"), restyled square. The draw plays once
 * when the visual scrolls into view; the play button, bin type and sliders keep working. No props.
 */
import GridFrame from "../GridFrame.astro";
---
<GridFrame id="bins" pad="none" flush aria-labelledby="bins-title">
  <div class="pd-head">
    <h2 id="bins-title" class="t-h2">Know what’s in the bin.</h2>
    <div class="stack-tight">
      <p class="t-lead">Keep track of material as it is stored, mixed and drawn. Explore how wet and dry quantities change in this example.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pd-panel">
    <div class="pd-bins"><div data-visual="bins" data-pd-bins></div></div>
    <div class="pd-foot">
      <p>A split bin draws the oldest layer first. A mix bin draws from every layer in proportion. The water leaves with the biochar, so the truck carries more than the dry figure.</p>
      <p class="t-caption">One square is 10 kg of dry biochar. Illustrative records.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</GridFrame>
